msgstr "ホワイトバランス制御モード"

#: ../../source/programming_resources/vision/webcam_controls/white_balance/mode/mode.rst:4
msgid ""
":java:extdoc:`org.firstinspires.ftc.robotcore.external.hardware.camera.controls.WhiteBalanceControl.Mode`"
